 the principal market for the 0G and BTC that it holds, and the end-of-day quoted price is both readily available and representative of fair value (Level 1 inputs).","context":"The Company recorded $24.4 million in realized losses on the use of digital assets for the repayment under stipulations of the Zero Gravity Convertible Note during the six months ended June 30, 2026 ($nil for the six months ended June 30, 2026). See Note 9.","section":"Item 1. Financial Statements","block":195,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001062993-26-003961","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-07-31","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001790169","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1790169/000106299326003961/form10q.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/06e4f4cc3be5df9a4b2f68a38421fd080087e4bd59e50d917d53154926276116.bin","sha256":"06e4f4cc3be5df9a4b2f68a38421fd080087e4bd59e50d917d53154926276116"}},{"id":"30e4fa3624cf0842ca2c847f35ba40c1904f1aead69d5a632f936a08b781294f","quote":"On September 23, 2025, the Company entered into an ATM sales agreement (the \"Sales Agreement\") with Revere Securities LLC (the \"Agent\") pursuant to which the Company may sell from time to time, at its option, Common Shares through the Agent in its capacity as sales agent. The sale of Common Shares, if any, will be made under the Company's Registration Statement, by any method that is deemed to be an \"at the market offering\" as defined in Rule 415(a)(4) under the Securities Act.","context":"AT THE MARKET (\"ATM\") OFFERING","section":"Item 1. Financial Statements","block":248,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001062993-26-003961","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-07-31","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001790169","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1790169/000106299326003961/form10q.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/06e4f4cc3be